## Identity Specifications License (CC-BY-ND 4.0)

**Applies to:** `system.md`, `now.md`, `llms.txt`, and all identity-defining documents.

**Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivatives 4.0 International**

You are free to:
- **Share** — copy and redistribute the material in any medium or format for any purpose, even commercially.

Under the following terms:
- **Attribution** — You must give appropriate credit to Paul Desai (Active MirrorOS™), provide a link to the license, and indicate if changes were made (though changes are not permitted).
- **NoDerivatives** — If you remix, transform, or build upon the material, you may not distribute the modified material. This prevents identity forking and impersonation.

**Why NoDerivatives?**  
This repository is a **sovereign identity anchor**. Allowing derivatives would enable identity forgery. You may reference, cite, or link to these documents, but you may not create modified versions and claim them as part of the ~active-mirror-paul identity.

Full license text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nd/4.0/legalcode

